From 7301ca05ba28aa2d83926c6538b07e5ea4e38e85 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: strata-jetson-port <strata-jetson@local>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 21:19:10 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] port(aarch64): NEON Q2_0 expert kernel + ISA shims for
 Jetson (Orin NX, sm_87)

- include/strata/portability.hpp: _mm_pause/_mm_sfence shims (__yield / dmb ishst)
- graph.cpp, verify.cpp, pool.cpp: portability shims instead of raw immintrin
- expert.cpp: Q2_0 CPU expert kernel gains an aarch64 NEON (+dotprod) path;
  x86 AVX2/AVX-512 paths preserved verbatim behind STRATA_X86
- expert_layout.cpp: CPUID probes return false on ARM; CpuFeatures gates on
  HWCAP ASIMDDP; q2_rows_any/act_quant_any dispatch to the NEON kernel
- CMakeLists.txt: x86-only kernel files excluded on aarch64; expert.cpp
  compiled with -march=armv8.2-a+dotprod
